{"parentUuid":"9cfeb269-f948-41fa-895d-2eba06c78a4e","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"056419f6-a62c-4dd1-b315-aa0831b33a15","agentId":"a7460c780eaa03097","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017rh7Y8SEHHTfcDDioaLYS9","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Gemini 3 Pro release date API pricing 2026\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Agent Platform Pricing | Google Cloud\",\"url\":\"https://cloud.google.com/gemini-enterprise-agent-platform/generative-ai/pricing\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini 3.1 Pro Preview API Pricing 2026 - Costs, Performance & Providers\",\"url\":\"https://pricepertoken.com/pricing-page/model/google-gemini-3.1-pro-preview\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini 3.1 Pro Preview - API Pricing & Benchmarks | OpenRouter\",\"url\":\"https://openrouter.ai/google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview\"},{\"title\":\"How Much Are Gemini 3 Pro and Gemini 3 API in 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.glbgpt.com/hub/gemini-3-pro-costs-gemini-3-api-costs-latest-insights-for-2025/\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini 3 Pro Preview - API Pricing & Providers | OpenRouter\",\"url\":\"https://openrouter.ai/google/gemini-3-pro-preview\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini 3.1 Pro API: Setup, Pricing, Limits, and Migration Guide (2026) | LaoZhang AI Blog\",\"url\":\"https://blog.laozhang.ai/en/posts/gemini-3-1-pro-preview-free-api\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini Pricing in 2026 for Individuals, Orgs & Developers\",\"url\":\"https://www.finout.io/blog/gemini-pricing-in-2026\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini 3.1 Pro API Pricing & Performance: The Complete 2026 Guide for Developers\",\"url\":\"https://www.glbgpt.com/hub/gemini-3-1-pro-api-pricing-performance-the-complete-guide-for-developers/\"},{\"title\":\"Google Gemini API Pricing May 2026: Gemini 3.1 Pro, Free Tier Changes | AI Pricing Guru\",\"url\":\"https://www.aipricing.guru/google-ai-pricing/\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini 3.1 Pro Complete Guide 2026: Benchmarks, Pricing, API & Everything You Need to Know | NxCode\",\"url\":\"https://www.nxcode.io/resources/news/gemini-3-1-pro-complete-guide-benchmarks-pricing-api-2026\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about Gemini 3 Pro release date and API pricing in 2026:\n\n## Release Date\n\nGemini 3 Pro was launched on November 18, 2025. Additionally, Gemini 3.1 Pro Preview was released on February 19, 2026, representing a newer version of the model.\n\n## API Pricing (2026)\n\n**Gemini 3 Pro:**\n- Gemini 3 Pro costs $2.00 per 1M input tokens (≤200k context) and $12.00 per 1M output tokens. Above 200k context, input rises to $4.00/1M and output to $18.00/1M.\n\n**Gemini 3.1 Pro:**\n- As of March 28, 2026, the standard rate is $2 input / $12 output per 1M tokens for prompts up to 200k tokens, then $4 / $18 above that threshold.\n- It's the same price as Gemini 3 Pro — $2 per million input tokens.\n\n**Key Pricing Changes:**\n- As of April 1, 2026: Gemini Pro models are now paid-only. Flash and Flash-Lite retain free tiers with reduced daily quotas.\n- Cached input drops to $0.20 per 1M — a 90% discount.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"fab6e1ac-f7a7-4028-86fe-2c707c5e5922","timestamp":"2026-05-10T02:00:56.378Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"9cfeb269-f948-41fa-895d-2eba06c78a4e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"aca27f88-e777-40a6-8c00-e2e79fc2973a","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"056419f6-a62c-4dd1-b315-aa0831b33a15","agentId":"a7460c780eaa03097","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014dChhwv8R2BBXhSZyqvvEv","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Gemini 3.1 Pro announced Google DeepMind\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Gemini 3.1 Pro — Google DeepMind\",\"url\":\"https://deepmind.google/models/gemini/pro/\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini 3 — Google DeepMind\",\"url\":\"https://deepmind.google/models/gemini/\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini 3.1 Pro - Model Card — Google DeepMind\",\"url\":\"https://deepmind.google/models/model-cards/gemini-3-1-pro/\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini 3.1 Pro: A smarter model for your most complex tasks\",\"url\":\"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/gemini-models/gemini-3-1-pro/\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini 3.1 Pro | Google's Most Advanced AI Model 2026\",\"url\":\"https://gemini3.us/gemini-3.1-pro\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini 3.1 Deep Think — Google DeepMind\",\"url\":\"https://deepmind.google/models/gemini/deep-think/\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini 3.1 Pro Review. Google DeepMind released the Gemini 3.1… | by Barnacle Goose | Medium\",\"url\":\"https://medium.com/@leucopsis/gemini-3-1-pro-review-1403a8aa1a96\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini 3: Introducing the latest Gemini AI model from Google\",\"url\":\"https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/gemini/gemini-3/\"},{\"title\":\"Google’s Gemini 3.1 Pro Just Doubled Its Predecessor’s Reasoning Score — At Half the Price of Opus 4.6 | by ADITHYA GIRIDHARAN | Medium\",\"url\":\"https://medium.com/@AdithyaGiridharan/googles-gemini-3-1-2375d2912dc8\"},{\"title\":\"Google Launches Deep Research Agents Powered by Gemini 3.1 Pro for Enterprise Use | Technobezz\",\"url\":\"https://www.technobezz.com/news/google-launches-deep-research-agents-powered-by-gemini-31-pro-for-enterprise-use\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what was announced about Gemini 3.1 Pro by Google DeepMind:\n\n## Release and Overview\n\nGemini 3.1 Pro is Google DeepMind's most advanced AI model, released on February 19, 2026. It represents an upgraded core intelligence that makes breakthroughs possible, with Google shipping it across consumer and developer products to bring progress in intelligence to everyday applications.\n\n## Key Capabilities\n\nGemini 3.1 Pro is the next iteration in the Gemini 3 series of models, a suite of highly capable, natively multimodal reasoning models, and as of this model card's date of publication, it is Google's most advanced model for complex tasks. \n\nThis new model shows improved reasoning, scoring significantly higher on complex problem-solving benchmarks. It delivers a 2x+ reasoning boost over Gemini 3 Pro, ranks #1 on 12 of 18 tracked benchmarks, and supports 1M token context with 65K token output.\n\n## Availability\n\nStarting today, Gemini 3.1 Pro in the Gemini app is rolling out with higher limits for users with the Google AI Pro and Ultra plans, it is now available on NotebookLM exclusively for Pro and Ultra users, and developers and enterprises can access it now in preview in the Gemini API via AI Studio, Antigravity, Vertex AI, Gemini Enterprise, Gemini CLI and Android Studio.\n\n## Pricing\n\nGemini 3.1 Pro costs $2 per 1M input tokens and $12 per 1M output tokens — the same price as Gemini 3 Pro.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"d26952b9-967d-469d-9825-7da45d621ed5","timestamp":"2026-05-10T02:01:00.211Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"aca27f88-e777-40a6-8c00-e2e79fc2973a","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
