{"parentUuid":"5c38fb72-8ea7-447b-ada3-7d5ecbd56c16","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"056419f6-a62c-4dd1-b315-aa0831b33a15","agentId":"a7460c780eaa03097","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012yg4S9NbpcBWGdTu5QSqUb","type":"tool_result","content":"# Gemini 3.x Model Variants\n\nBased on the documentation, here are the currently available Gemini 3.x models:\n\n## Gemini 3.1 Series\n\n**Gemini 3.1 Pro**\n- Status: Preview\n- Description: \"Advanced intelligence, complex problem-solving skills, and powerful agentic and vibe coding capabilities.\"\n- Context window: Not specified\n- Free tier: Not indicated\n\n**Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite**\n- Status: Stable (also has a Preview version available)\n- Description: \"Frontier-class performance rivaling larger models at a fraction of the cost.\"\n- Context window: Not specified\n- Free tier: Not indicated\n\n**Gemini 3.1 Flash Live**\n- Status: New Preview\n- Description: \"High-quality, low-latency Live API model for real-time dialogue and voice-first AI applications.\"\n- Context window: Not specified\n- Free tier: Not indicated\n\n**Gemini 3.1 Flash TTS**\n- Status: New Preview\n- Description: \"Powerful, low-latency speech generation.\"\n- Context window: Not specified\n- Free tier: Not indicated\n\n## Gemini 3 Series\n\n**Gemini 3 Flash**\n- Status: Preview\n- Description: \"Frontier-class performance rivaling larger models at a fraction of the cost.\"\n- Context window: Not specified\n- Free tier: Not indicated\n\n**Note:** The page indicates that \"Gemini 3 Pro Preview is deprecated and has been shut down March 9, 2026.\"\n\nThe documentation does not provide context window sizes or explicit free tier availability information for these models."}]},"uuid":"dd3b068a-4889-4d7c-b9c2-4a3cbfc1a2d8","timestamp":"2026-05-10T02:01:16.913Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"5c38fb72-8ea7-447b-ada3-7d5ecbd56c16","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"d87b185f-bc24-4a52-9ae3-ca71d4f295f2","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"056419f6-a62c-4dd1-b315-aa0831b33a15","agentId":"a7460c780eaa03097","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Pc6MdRvCWWHzLP5aM2pNd3","type":"tool_result","content":"# Gemini 3.x Pricing Summary\n\n## Gemini 3.1 Pro Preview\n**Input:** $2.00 (≤200k tokens) / $4.00 (>200k tokens) per 1M  \n**Output:** $12.00 (≤200k) / $18.00 (>200k) per 1M  \n**Free tier:** Not available\n\n## Gemini 3 Flash Preview\n**Input:** $0.50 (text/image/video), $1.00 (audio) per 1M  \n**Output:** $3.00 per 1M  \n**Free tier:** Full free access available\n\n## Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite\n**Input:** $0.25 (text/image/video), $0.50 (audio) per 1M  \n**Output:** $1.50 per 1M  \n**Free tier:** Full free access available\n\n## Gemini 2.5 Pro Comparison\n**Input:** $1.25 (≤200k) / $2.50 (>200k) per 1M  \n**Output:** $10.00 (≤200k) / $15.00 (>200k) per 1M\n\n---\n\n**Key difference:** Gemini 3.1 Pro represents a significant price increase versus 2.5 Pro (60% higher input, 20% higher output), reflecting its \"latest performance, intelligence, and usability improvements\" for advanced multimodal tasks."}]},"uuid":"278dac65-53a5-4e10-b9b9-02266bd681b8","timestamp":"2026-05-10T02:01:21.016Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d87b185f-bc24-4a52-9ae3-ca71d4f295f2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
