{"parentUuid":"4cce16b6-2cf3-44eb-b901-f2a9bbbdb5c3","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a7460c780eaa03097","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01MVuHzWWTDEbFqP3rRVAGbp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Du7uEMpTxqkGJN9BKSNBE1","name":"WebSearch","input":{"query":"OpenEvolve gemini-3-pro OpenAI compatible endpoint model name"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1450,"cache_read_input_tokens":29425,"output_tokens":130,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1450},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":130,"cache_read_input_tokens":29425,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1450,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1450,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011Cat4f2pkxRYGbzdipPzWA","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"8b4cd3ba-a42c-4d9f-9591-88bd49ee96d1","timestamp":"2026-05-10T02:01:24.751Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"8b4cd3ba-a42c-4d9f-9591-88bd49ee96d1","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"056419f6-a62c-4dd1-b315-aa0831b33a15","agentId":"a7460c780eaa03097","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Du7uEMpTxqkGJN9BKSNBE1","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"OpenEvolve gemini-3-pro OpenAI compatible endpoint model name\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"OpenAI compatibility | Gemini API | Google AI for Developers\",\"url\":\"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/openai\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini 3.1 Pro | Generative AI on Vertex AI | Google Cloud Documentation\",\"url\":\"https://docs.cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/generative-ai/docs/models/gemini/3-1-pro\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini 3 Developer Guide - generateContent API\",\"url\":\"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/gemini-3\"},{\"title\":\"OpenAI compatibility | Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform | Google Cloud Documentation\",\"url\":\"https://docs.cloud.google.com/gemini-enterprise-agent-platform/models/start/openai\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - PublicAffairs/openai-gemini: ✦ Gemini ➜ OpenAI API proxy. Serverless!\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/PublicAffairs/openai-gemini\"},{\"title\":\"Models | OpenCode\",\"url\":\"https://opencode.ai/docs/models/\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini 3 Pro Preview Deprecation Guide\",\"url\":\"https://evolink.ai/blog/gemini-3-pro-deprecation-migrate-to-3-1-pro\"},{\"title\":\"Gemini 3.1 Pro API in 2026: Pricing, Real-World Performance & the Fastest Way to Get Started\",\"url\":\"https://ofox.ai/blog/gemini-3-1-pro-api-pricing-performance-guide-2026/\"},{\"title\":\"Models | Gemini API | Google AI for Developers\",\"url\":\"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/models\"},{\"title\":\"OpenCode + EvoLink: Access Claude, GPT & Gemini via One API (2026)\",\"url\":\"https://evolink.ai/blog/opencode-integration-guide-access-claude-4-5-gpt-5-2-gemini-3-pro-evolink-api\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found information about OpenAI-compatible endpoints for Gemini models, though the specific query about \"OpenEvolve\" didn't return direct results. However, I can provide relevant information:\n\n## OpenAI-Compatible Gemini Endpoints\n\nThe Gemini API provides an OpenAI-compatible endpoint at `https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/openai/`.\n\nFor the model name \"gemini-3-pro\" specifically, Gemini 3 Pro Preview is deprecated and has been shut down March 9, 2026, with migration to Gemini 3.1 Pro Preview recommended to avoid service disruption.\n\nWhen using OpenAI-compatible endpoints with Gemini models:\n- The compatible Gemini model parameter would be `gemini-3-flash-preview` (for the Flash version)\n- For the Pro versions, both `gemini-3-pro-preview` and `gemini-3.1-pro-preview` are supported through some providers like EvoLink\n\nThe search results don't show a specific service called \"OpenEvolve\" - did you perhaps mean \"EvoLink\" or another API gateway? If you have more details about the specific service you're asking about, I can search for more targeted information.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"41ac97cf-9b18-4e5a-9861-e139870ea444","timestamp":"2026-05-10T02:01:30.658Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8b4cd3ba-a42c-4d9f-9591-88bd49ee96d1","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"41ac97cf-9b18-4e5a-9861-e139870ea444","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a7460c780eaa03097","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_012Ww8q1LhrMuvCyNbzg4sCt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"信息齐了，给出报告。\n\n## Gemini 3.x 已发布版本\n\n- **Gemini 3 Pro**: 2025-11-18 发布（preview），2026-03-09 已 deprecated 关停\n- **Gemini 3.1 Pro Preview**: 2026-02-19 发布，当前 Pro 主推（reasoning 比 3 Pro +2x，1M context / 65K output）\n- **Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite**: stable + preview 双轨，最便宜\n- **Gemini 3 Flash Preview**: preview\n- **Gemini 3.1 Flash Live / Flash TTS**: new preview（语音/实时）\n- **Gemini 3.1 Deep Think**: 独立旗舰 reasoning 路径\n\n## API 价格 (per 1M tok, ≤200k context)\n\n| 模型 | Input | Output |\n|---|---|---|\n| Gemini 3.1 Pro | $2.00 / $4.00 (>200k) | $12.00 / $18.00 |\n| Gemini 3 Pro | $2.00 / $4.00 | $12.00 / $18.00（同价，已停） |\n| **Gemini 2.5 Pro** | **$1.25 / $2.50** | **$10.00 / $15.00** |\n| Gemini 3 Flash Preview | $0.50 | $3.00 |\n| Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite | $0.25 | $1.50 |\n| Claude Opus 4.7 (参考) | ~$15 | ~$75 |\n| Claude Sonnet 4.6 (参考) | ~$3 | ~$15 |\n\n3.1 Pro 比 2.5 Pro 贵 +60% input / +20% output；但 cached input 打 9 折 ($0.20)；2026-04-01 起 **Pro 系列已无 free tier**，只 Flash/Flash-Lite 留免费。\n\n## API 接入\n\n- **ai.google.dev (AI Studio / Gemini API)**: 是，preview 可直接调\n- **Vertex AI**: 是\n- **OpenAI-compatible 端点**: 是，`https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/openai/`，model name 用 `gemini-3.1-pro-preview` / `gemini-3-flash-preview`\n\n## 推荐 (P2 #14 PoC production)\n\n**直接换 `gemini-3.1-pro-preview`**，原因：\n1. 2.5 Pro 仍可用但 3.1 Pro 是当前 frontier，benchmark 显著领先\n2. OpenEvolve OpenAI-compatible 配置只需改 model name，零代码改动\n3. 价格虽 +60% input 但仍只有 Claude Opus 4.7 的约 1/7，PoC 阶段成本可控\n4. Pro 系列 free tier 已废，反正都得走 paid Tier 1，没有\"免费\"诱因留 2.5\n\n**唯一风险**：3.1 Pro 还是 preview 状态，参考 3 Pro Preview 4 个月就 deprecated 的节奏，production 长期跑要做好 4-6 个月一次迁移的准备。Flash-Lite 当 fallback / 大批量 candidate 评估首选（$0.25 input 比 2.5 Flash 还便宜）。\n\nSources:\n- [Gemini 3.1 Pro - Google DeepMind](https://deepmind.google/models/gemini/pro/)\n- [Gemini 3.1 Pro blog](https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/gemini-models/gemini-3-1-pro/)\n- [Gemini API Models](https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/models)\n- [Gemini API Pricing](https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/pricing)\n- [OpenAI compatibility - Gemini API](https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/openai)\n- [Gemini 3 Pro Preview Deprecation Guide](https://evolink.ai/blog/gemini-3-pro-deprecation-migrate-to-3-1-pro)"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1319,"cache_read_input_tokens":30875,"output_tokens":1414,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1319},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":1414,"cache_read_input_tokens":30875,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1319,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1319,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011Cat4fjcwH4KhJznGAAtXd","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"7fcaf4b9-2a33-4670-86be-5837f685acf2","timestamp":"2026-05-10T02:01:53.593Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
